    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Il film narra una storia d'amore: a viverla una donna di quasi sessant'anni con un giovane arabo di trenta. Uno sguardo sulle mille contraddizioni contemporanee e su un futuro del tutto imperscrutabile.",
        "english": "Adriana is almost 60 years old, she was born in France but has lived most of her life in Italy with her daughter and nephew. She has worked as a nurse in the local hospital for quite some time. One day, she finds herself in the laneway of the hospital where she meets Mohamed, a 30 year old Arabic man. A romance quickly ensues between them but it is destined to be a scandal for the town. Will Adriana and Mohamed, who were so alone before meeting each other, be able to defend their love against the criticizers who surround them?"
